      "source_excerpt": "protocolSection.armsInterventionsModule.armGroups and outcomesModule.primaryOutcomes/secondaryOutcomes: \"A Study to Assess Efficacy and Safety of JNJ-77242113 Compared to Placebo and Ustekinumab in Participants With Moderate to Severe Plaque Psoriasis\" \"Participants will receive JNJ-77242113 once daily from Week 0 through Week 104.\" \"Participants will receive matching placebo for JNJ-77242113 from Week 0 through Week 16, matching placebo for ustekinumab at Week 0, 4 and 16 and JNJ-77242113 from Week 16 through Week 104.\" \"Participants will receive Ustekinumab at Week 0, Week 4, and Week 16 followed by JNJ-77242113 once daily from Week 28 through Week 104.\" \"Participants will receive both Ustekinumab and placebo for JNJ-77242113 to maintain the blind through Week 28.\" \"Week 16\" \"Week 16\" \"Week 28\" \"Up to Week 108\" \"JNJ-77242113 and Placebo Group: Percentage of Participants with Investigator's Global Assessment (IGA) Score of 0 or 1 and Greater than or Equal to (>=) 2 Grade Improvement from Baseline at Week 16\" \"JNJ-77242113 and Placebo Group: Percentage of Participants Achieving Psoriasis Area and Severity Index (PASI) 90 Response at Week 16\" -- The registry describes assigned treatment through Week 104, with arm-dependent treatment changes: placebo crosses to JNJ-77242113 at Week 16, and the ustekinumab arm receives ustekinumab through Week 16 then JNJ-77242113 from Week 28; that arm's description says the blind is maintained through Week 28. The primary outcomes are assessed at Week 16; listed key secondary assessments include Weeks 16 and 28. The Week 108 entry is the AE/SAE observation timeframe only, so it does not establish end_of_study_week or total_duration_weeks. The supplied CT.gov record has no per-visit schedule table; visit cadence, visit dates, screening duration, and study end are therefore left null. The primary endpoint reference criteria restate the registry outcome measures: IGA 0 or 1 with at least a 2-grade improvement, and PASI 90 response, both at Week 16.",
